Self-hosted Firecrawl entrypoint exposing firecrawl_scrape only

Require FIRECRAWL_API_URL and drop the hosted service layer (OAuth, search
profile, keyless). Register only firecrawl_scrape (toolFilter) and narrow its
cloud-oriented definition to what a self-hosted instance supports (wrapTool).

